{"4312610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lubs 2: Straw Hats", "steam_appid": 4312610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yunlingen Must Be in Peace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reindall the holy guardian was chained in Junlin castle that helds by Kriltons. The Holy Council asked the Emperor take back Tilennar Empire's legendary castle Junlin. So Reindall would be rescued. On the other hand Kriltons were growing on both north and south. That was the time to call Straw Hats. That was the time to pay their debt to Tilennar and The Council!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/0ff618854719e3376dda5375071dddab.poster.avif?t=1787015436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/0ff618854719e3376dda5375071dddab.webm?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/0ff618854719e3376dda5375071dddab.mp4?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prominent Melee Fights!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betreyal is everywhere and you've to be ready for both traitors and tough sword clanging! You need to wait and avoid strokes to hit hard. Trust your sword and mind but to nobody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1d4c644c03a2203d2a46eaeb192fbd22.poster.avif?t=1787015436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1d4c644c03a2203d2a46eaeb192fbd22.webm?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1d4c644c03a2203d2a46eaeb192fbd22.mp4?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursue Improvment!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Straw hats allow you to improve your character. Beat your enemies and earn points! Whether melee or range attack! Don't worry! You can play however you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1092917d8c430a130ce1fa9e5d4731aa.poster.avif?t=1787015436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1092917d8c430a130ce1fa9e5d4731aa.webm?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1092917d8c430a130ce1fa9e5d4731aa.mp4?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tale of South!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the southern Yunlingen civilians' story. Make decisions to help people. Also watch arounds to find unique. It may be valuable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/7e5be708b7def7cc0fac5624ed796466.poster.avif?t=1787015436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/7e5be708b7def7cc0fac5624ed796466.webm?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/7e5be708b7def7cc0fac5624ed796466.mp4?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yunlingen Must Be in Peace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reindall the holy guardian was chained in Junlin castle that helds by Kriltons. The Holy Council asked the Emperor take back Tilennar Empire's legendary castle Junlin. So Reindall would be rescued. On the other hand Kriltons were growing on both north and south. That was the time to call Straw Hats. That was the time to pay their debt to Tilennar and The Council!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/0ff618854719e3376dda5375071dddab.poster.avif?t=1787015436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/0ff618854719e3376dda5375071dddab.webm?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/0ff618854719e3376dda5375071dddab.mp4?t=1787015436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prominent Melee Fights!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betreyal is everywhere and you've to be ready for both traitors and tough sword clanging! You need to wait and avoid strokes to hit hard. Trust your sword and mind but to nobody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1d4c644c03a2203d2a46eaeb192fbd22.poster.avif?t=1787015436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312610/extras/1d4c644c03a2203d2a46eaeb192fbd22